'''Barry HQ''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Village Plaza}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the {{zone|Election Room}}.

== Features ==
'''Barry HQ''' features a few attractions.

=== Protestors ===
{{See also|Barry}}
Once the player resolves all of the protestors' complaints in the {{zone|Barry Center}}, they will each move to the '''Barry HQ'''. After resolving all the complaints, [[Barry]] will gift the player a [[Barry's Montgray Pen]].

=== Old Election Box ===
At the back of '''Barry HQ''' is the {{Green|{{ID|Jukebox!Old Election Box|nolink=true}}}}, which contains the {{Item|SkyBlock Citizen Timecharm}}. It can be purchased for {{Item|Scribe Crux|amount=16}}es and a {{Item|Barry's Montgray Pen}}.

